 "units": [
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.27.2",
   "range": "LEV.27.2",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "0a480148",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.27.2#p1-31904af9",
     "text": "As of his son or daughter.",
     "label": "a",
     "anchor": "singular vow"
    },
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.27.2#p2-8c2876ba",
     "text": "Who art the priest.",
     "label": "b",
     "anchor": "thy estimation"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.27.3",
   "range": "LEV.27.3",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "a8ee192a",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.27.3#p1-a8ee192a",
     "text": "Read the value of the shekel in Ex 30:13.",
     "label": "c",
     "anchor": "shekels of silver",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Ex 30:13",
       "ref": "EXO.30.13"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.27.6",
   "range": "LEV.27.6",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "7859ecb3",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.27.6#p1-7859ecb3",
     "text": "He speaks of those vows by which the fathers dedicated their children to God who were not of such force; but they might be redeemed from them.",
     "label": "d",
     "anchor": "month old even unto five years"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.27.8",
   "range": "LEV.27.8",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "3142cabf",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.27.8#p1-3142cabf",
     "text": "If he is not able to pay according to your estimate.",
     "label": "e",
     "anchor": "than thy estimation"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.27.9",
   "range": "LEV.27.9",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "61ba825e",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.27.9#p1-61ba825e",
     "text": "Which is clean, Le 11:2.",
     "label": "f",
     "anchor": "beast",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Le 11:2",
       "ref": "LEV.11.2"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.27.10",
   "range": "LEV.27.10",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "7e191848",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.27.10#p1-7e191848",
     "text": "That is, consecrate to the Lord.",
     "label": "g",
     "anchor": "holy"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.27.16",
   "range": "LEV.27.16",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "5769b5ea",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.27.16#p1-5769b5ea",
     "text": "Homer is a measure containing ten ephahs, read of an ephah in Ex 16:16,36.",
     "label": "i",
     "anchor": "homer of barley seed shall be",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Ex 16:16,36",
       "ref": "EXO.16.16"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ex 16:16,36",
       "ref": "EXO.16.36"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.27.20",
   "range": "LEV.27.20",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "e386202f",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.27.20#p1-e386202f",
     "text": "For their own necessity or godly uses.",
     "label": "k",
     "anchor": "sold the field to another man"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.27.21",
   "range": "LEV.27.21",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "e7fa0dc3",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.27.21#p1-e7fa0dc3",
     "text": "That is, who dedicate to the Lord with a curse to him that turns it to his private use, Nu 21:2, De 13:15, Jos 9:17.",
     "label": "l",
     "anchor": "holy unto the LORD",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Nu 21:2, De 13:15, Jos 9:17",
       "ref": "NUM.21.2"
      },
      {
       "text": "Nu 21:2, De 13:15, Jos 9:17",
       "ref": "DEU.13.15"
      },
      {
       "text": "Nu 21:2, De 13:15, Jos 9:17",
       "ref": "JOS.9.17"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.27.23",
   "range": "LEV.27.23",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "95cfe907",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.27.23#p1-95cfe907",
     "text": "The priests evaluation.",
     "label": "m",
     "anchor": "thine estimation in that day"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.27.26",
   "range": "LEV.27.26",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "14feea8f",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.27.26#p1-14feea8f",
     "text": "It was the Lord's already.",
     "label": "n",
     "anchor": "LORD'S"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.27.29",
   "range": "LEV.27.29",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "03be71bf",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.27.29#p1-03be71bf",
     "text": "It shall remain without redemption.",
     "label": "o",
     "anchor": "put to death"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.27.31",
   "range": "LEV.27.31",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "047536b5",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.27.31#p1-047536b5",
     "text": "Besides the value of the thing itself.",
     "label": "p",
     "anchor": "fifth part thereof"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/LEV.27.32",
   "range": "LEV.27.32",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "77a39263",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/LEV.27.32#p1-77a39263",
     "text": "All that which is numbered: that is, every tenth as he falls by tale without exception or respect.",
     "label": "q",
     "anchor": "rod"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
